OL,3,GNEWSAFive boys arrested over city      
OL,4,Acentre building fire                   
OL,6,FFive teenage boys have been arrested   
OL,7,Fafter a fire at a derelict building in 
OL,8,FNottingham city centre.                
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to      
OL,11,FNottingham Guildhall, in Burton Street,
OL,12,Fat about 14:20 GMT on Friday after a   
OL,13,Fsmall fire was spotted on the roof,    
OL,14,Fwhich was quickly put out.             
OL,16,FSuspects were spotted on the roof and  
OL,17,Ftwo boys, both 17, were arrested at the
OL,18,Fscene.                                 
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
