OL,3,GNEWSAFive boys arrested over city      
OL,4,Acentre building fire                   
OL,6,FAn investigation concluded the fire had
OL,7,Fbeen started deliberately, police said,
OL,8,Fand a 14-year-old boy was arrested on  
OL,9,FSaturday before a 13-year-old boy was  
OL,10,Fdetained on Sunday, and another        
OL,11,F14-year-old boy was taken into custody 
OL,12,Fon Thursday.                           
